<p>Your ticket <var>{{ ticket }}</var> has been created.</p>
<p>To view the ticket and update it, if required, click 👉 <a href="{{ domain }}/talks/threads/{{ thread_id }}?access_token={{ token }}">here</a> 👈</p>
<p class="warning">Note that the link above is the only link you can use to access the ticket, unless you register, and it gets updated with every post, even if that post was made by you. We recommend keeping this email for future tracking of progress, or until you get an email about an update, which will have a newer link.</p>
